flowchart LR
    A[User submits support request] --> B[Extract intake details]
    B --> C[Classify issue, team, and severity]
    C --> D[Create customer if found]
    D --> E[Create support case]
    E --> F[Open workflow run]
    F --> G[Try ADK root agent]
    G --> H[Task, notes, and calendar agents]
    H --> I[MCP tool calls]
    I --> J[Persist tasks, notes, and events]
    G --> K{AI succeeded?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Return Gemini ADK result]
    K -->|No| M[Run deterministic fallback]
    M --> J
    J --> N[Store workflow summary and steps]
    N --> O[Display results in the web app]
